    "body": "So your suggestion would be to remove `[Replaceable] readonly` from Web IDL?\r\n\r\nIt seems like that would probably not break\r\n```js\r\nvar name = \"prettier\";\r\n```\r\nbut it would break something like\r\n```js\r\nvar name = 42;\r\n```\r\nor\r\n```js\r\nvar name = { toString: () => { throw 1; } };\r\n```\r\nright?",
